  description: 'When this card is activated: Add 1 "The Winged Dragon of Ra" or 1
    card that mentions it from your Deck to your hand, except "The True Sun God".
    Monsters, except "The Winged Dragon of Ra", cannot attack the turn they are Special
    Summoned. Once per turn, during your Main Phase: You can send this card from
    the field, or 1 "The Winged Dragon of Ra - Immortal Phoenix" from your Deck,
    to the GY, then send 1 "The Winged Dragon of Ra" from your Monster Zone to the
    GY. You can only activate 1 "The True Sun God" per turn.'
